From ccbe8800ebd847f9d6ce39734c6435674eeab054 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:59:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Structure import is names and descriptions only; scripts come
 as files

POST /courses/import no longer accepts scriptText (and drops the 20 MB body
limit). Scripts go through PUT /courses/:courseId/scripts; a changed script
clears the typo-check marker, and re-uploading the pre-fix original of a
proofread script counts as unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SfrJH4SbgPjULJKHTAFnx
